# PoE2LI Environment Variables

# OpenRouter API Key (LLM — primary, free tier)
# Register at: https://openrouter.ai
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=your_openrouter_key_here

# SiliconFlow API Key (Embedding + LLM backup)
# Register at: https://cloud.siliconflow.cn
SILICONFLOW_API_KEY=your_siliconflow_key_here

# Proxy (optional)
# HTTPS_PROXY=http://192.168.110.26:7890
# HTTP_PROXY=http://192.168.110.26:7890

# ── LLM Provider Switching ──
# Default: OpenRouter free tier (qwen/qwen3-next-80b-a3b-instruct:free)
# To switch to SiliconFlow paid (deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash),
# edit docker-compose.yml: comment out OpenRouter LLM lines, uncomment SiliconFlow LLM lines.
# Embedding always uses SiliconFlow BGE-M3 (free, high quality).
